# Blasted Lands (50-51): the Bloodmages' collections, Kum'isha and the Dreadmaul ogres, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/blasted_lands_50_51.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, drops and the places of the mobs from the game data
# (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Blasted Lands, area 4). The guide's quest list is
# section 15 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Added: Memories of Rockard (87451), a Horde quest started by a Carved Stone Trinket that the Dreadmaul
# ogres drop, handed in at Stonard (outof.games; on no guide's list).
# Left out:
#   Deflective Surface (87295): Bernie Heisten sells food inside Nethergarde Keep and is of the
#     Alliance (faction template 12, hostile to the Horde).
#   Chains That Bind (81917): it needs The Burning Beast (81900), found on an etching in Searing Gorge,
#     the next guide.
#   To Serve Kum'isha (2521): not in WoW Forever (outof.games has no such quest; its To Serve Kum'isha is
#     93685, the end of the Draenethyst chain from the Swamp of Sorrows, level 55), and its Flawless
#     Draenethyst Sphere is a drop of a level 60 elite dragon or one in thousands from anything else.
#
# The route: from Stonard south into the Blasted Lands; the Bloodmages; the scorpid valley south of
# them; Kum'isha and the plateau around her; the hyenas, vultures and boars of the east; back to
# Kum'isha and north to the Bloodmages; the Dreadmaul ogres; Stonard and a flight to Kargath.

guide Blasted Lands (50-51)
faction horde
levels 50 51
carry 3568 3908 4120
leave 3568 3908 4120
next Searing Gorge (51-51)

# Stonard to the Blasted Lands ----------------------------------------------------------------------

map Swamp of Sorrows
goto "Ride south-west from Stonard to the road into the Blasted Lands" at 34.3,66.1 r 40
tip The road passes the Fallen Hero of the Horde and climbs south through a long pass.

# The Bloodmages ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Blasted Lands
accept 2581 2583 2585
tip Bloodmage Drazial and Bloodmage Lynnore stand side by side, south of the pass from the Swamp of Sorrows.
accept 2601 2603
tip Their five quests all want the same five things: 14 Vulture Gizzards, 11 Basilisk Brains, 6 Blasted Boar Lungs, 6 Scorpok Pincers and 5 Snickerfang Jowls. Each quest's counter stops at its own share, so keep looting until you hold all of them.

# The scorpid valley south of the camp --------------------------------------------------------------

do 2603.1 bg mobs 5982 5983 8299 "Kill vultures for 14 Vulture Gizzards in all"
do 2581.1 bg mobs 5984 5985 8300 "Kill snickerfangs for 5 Snickerfang Jowls in all"
do 2585.1 at 47.3,20.4 mobs 5988 8301 "Kill Scorpok Stingers for 6 Scorpok Pincers in all"
tip The valley just south-west of the camp crawls with scorpoks; Black Slayers and Starving Snickerfangs share it.
tip Teremus the Devourer, a level 60 elite dragon, flies over the whole zone: watch the sky and keep out of his way.

# Kum'isha and the plateau around her -----------------------------------------------------------------

accept 3501
tip Kum'isha the Collector, a draenei, stands alone in the middle of the wastes.
do 3501 bg mobs 5993 5991 5985 5982
tip Any creature in the Blasted Lands can drop an Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment, about one in a hundred. One is enough.
do 2583.1 bg mobs 5993 5992 8303 "Kill boars for 6 Blasted Boar Lungs in all"
do 2601.1 at 52.9,38.3 mobs 5991 5990 8302 "Kill Redstone Crystalhides for 11 Basilisk Brains in all"
tip Crystalhides and Helboars graze together around Kum'isha and west of her, around 47,36. They share spawn points: killing one kind brings the other back, so kill both.
do 2583.1 at 46.4,36.0 mobs 5993 5992 8303 "Kill Helboars for 6 Blasted Boar Lungs in all"

# The hyenas, vultures and boars of the east ---------------------------------------------------------

do 2581.1 at 59.1,43.1 mobs 5985 8300 "Kill Snickerfang Hyenas for 5 Snickerfang Jowls in all"
tip The hyena packs roam east and south-east of Kum'isha. Hyenas share spawn points with the scorpoks, so the scorpid valley in the north has some too.
do 2603.1 at 61.0,27.2 mobs 5982 5983 8299 "Kill Black Slayers for 14 Vulture Gizzards in all"
tip Black Slayers circle in small groups at a handful of spots: here in the north-east (62,26), east of Kum'isha (56,36), south-east of her (55-60,41-45) and in the scorpid valley (46-50,17-19).

# Back to Kum'isha, then north to the Bloodmages -------------------------------------------------------

do 3501 at 53.0,38.5 mobs 5993 5991 5985 5982 "Kill anything around Kum'isha until an Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment drops"
tip No fragment yet? It's about one kill in a hundred, and each of you needs one: unless you're close, skip Everything Counts (right-click it) rather than grind for it. It's repeatable, so a fragment found later still pays.
turnin 3501
note "Count your bags: 14 Vulture Gizzards, 11 Basilisk Brains, 6 Blasted Boar Lungs, 6 Scorpok Pincers and 5 Snickerfang Jowls" npc 7363
tip Get what is missing on the way north: the scorpoks and the vultures of the valley are on the road back.
turnin 2601 2603
turnin 2581 2583 2585

# Dreadmaul Hold --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 87451 at 42.6,13.2 icon kill "Kill Dreadmaul ogres at Dreadmaul Hold until one drops a Carved Stone Trinket, then use it to start Memories of Rockard"
tip The ogre camp is just west of the Bloodmages; its ogres are level 45 to 47.

# Stonard, and on to Searing Gorge ---------------------------------------------------------------------

map Swamp of Sorrows
goto "Ride north out of the Blasted Lands to Stonard" at 46.5,55.0 r 30
tip If your hearthstone is set in Stonard, use it instead.
turnin 87451
tip Dispatch Commander Ruag stands in the middle of Stonard.
fly "Kargath, Badlands" npc 6026
tip The next guide starts at Kargath and rides east into Searing Gorge. If you already know Thorium Point, you can fly there instead.
